# Settings for the hosted Supabase project, used only by `vite build --mode hosted`
# (GitHub Pages and Vercel builds). Local and CI test builds never load this file.
# These values are public by design: the publishable key only identifies the
# project; every read and write is limited by sign-in and the database's
# access rules. Variables set by the build environment take priority.
